âÒ¾Ö ea00570d1814b25e75f0923d0c652e63
·W
findbt.ipynbúV{
  "metadata": {
    "kernelspec": {
      "display_name": "Jupyter Notebook",
      "name": "jupyter"
    }
  },
  "nbformat": 4,
  "nbformat_minor": 5,
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "46cc4024-5183-4dd6-b115-4bc9d7920903",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "codeCollapsed": true,
        "collapsed": false
      },
      "source": "# FIN_DB â€“ Account Data Platform Setup (Raw Layer)\n\n**Use case:** Daily financial-company account data lands in the Snowflake **RAW** layer as a full snapshot. dbt later loads it into the **SILVER** change-log table, inserting a row only when attributes change.\n\n| Item | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Natural key | `SLSFRC_ID` + `EFECTIVE_DT` |\n| Role | `FIN_DBT_DEV_ROLE` |\n| Warehouse | `FIN_DBT_WH` (XSMALL) |\n| Database / schemas | `FIN_DB.RAW`, `FIN_DB.SILVER` |\n\n> These steps were already executed on 2026-11-05. Steps 1â€“3 need **ACCOUNTADMIN**; steps 4â€“7 run as **FIN_DBT_DEV_ROLE**. Every statement is idempotent (`IF NOT EXISTS` / `OR REPLACE`), so re-running is safe; Step 4 recreates the table, which resets the data before Step 5 reloads it."
    },
    {
      "id": "6dc9900b-61a7-450e-9fb2-119add559fbc",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "codeCollapsed": false
      },
      "source": "## Step 1 â€“ Developer role\nCreate the role dbt runs as, and grant it to SYSADMIN (to keep the role hierarchy) and to the developer user."
    },
    {
      "id": "c5c2e603-eead-468e-963c-ae6aada869d5",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "sql",
        "resultVariableName": "step1_role",
        "title": "Create developer role"
      },
      "source": "%%sql -r step1_role\nUSE ROLE ACCOUNTADMIN;\nCREATE ROLE IF NOT EXISTS FIN_DBT_DEV_ROLE;\nGRANT ROLE FIN_DBT_DEV_ROLE TO ROLE SYSADMIN;\nGRANT ROLE FIN_DBT_DEV_ROLE TO USER SUSSAHU;",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null
    },
    {
      "id": "528b3cc0-6c33-4ab6-a934-a53d65f81a5d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "codeCollapsed": false
      },
      "source": "## Step 2 â€“ Warehouse\nAn XSMALL warehouse that auto-suspends after 60 seconds idle, to keep cost low."
    },
    {
      "id": "7e9f538d-5bc6-4ba5-b364-db48473ecbd8",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "sql",
        "resultVariableName": "step2_wh",
        "title": "Create warehouse"
      },
      "source": "%%sql -r step2_wh\nCREATE WAREHOUSE IF NOT EXISTS FIN_DBT_WH\n  WAREHOUSE_SIZE = 'XSMALL' AUTO_SUSPEND = 60 AUTO_RESUME = TRUE INITIALLY_SUSPENDED = TRUE;\nGRANT USAGE, OPERATE ON WAREHOUSE FIN_DBT_WH TO ROLE FIN_DBT_DEV_ROLE;",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null
    },
    {
      "id": "51e06640-5d0a-4c60-85d8-6fe63f8acef4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "codeCollapsed": false
      },
      "source": "## Step 3 â€“ Database, schemas and grants\n- `RAW`: as-landed daily snapshots\n- `SILVER`: curated change log, built by dbt\n- `EXECUTE TASK`: lets the role schedule the dbt run"
    },
    {
      "id": "cc7d371d-f54d-45d3-9d1c-744c15014133",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "sql",
        "resultVariableName": "step3_db",
        "title": "Create database, schemas, grants"
      },
      "source": "%%sql -r step3_db\nCREATE DATABASE IF NOT EXISTS FIN_DB;\nCREATE SCHEMA IF NOT EXISTS FIN_DB.RAW;\nCREATE SCHEMA IF NOT EXISTS FIN_DB.SILVER;\n\nGRANT USAGE ON DATABASE FIN_DB TO ROLE FIN_DBT_DEV_ROLE;\nGRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON SCHEMA FIN_DB.RAW    TO ROLE FIN_DBT_DEV_ROLE;\nGRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON SCHEMA FIN_DB.SILVER TO ROLE FIN_DBT_DEV_ROLE;\nGRANT EXECUTE TASK ON ACCOUNT TO ROLE FIN_DBT_DEV_ROLE;",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null
    },
    {
      "id": "208b2cd6-6f82-4032-9875-730829f0f913",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "codeCollapsed": false
      },
      "source": "## Step 4 â€“ Raw ACCOUNT table\nSwitch to the developer role so it owns the raw objects. `INGESTED_TS` is the load timestamp that dbt uses for incremental CDC."
    },
    {
      "id": "bb556a6e-330d-4f2e-ba04-6542e259f023",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "sql",
        "resultVariableName": "step4_table",
        "title": "Create raw table"
      },
      "source": "%%sql -r step4_table\nUSE ROLE FIN_DBT_DEV_ROLE;\nUSE WAREHOUSE FIN_DBT_WH;\n\nCREATE OR REPLACE TABLE FIN_DB.RAW.ACCOUNT (\n    SLSFRC_ID       VARCHAR(18),\n    EFECTIVE_DT     DATE,\n    ACCOUNT_NAME    VARCHAR,\n    ACCOUNT_TYPE    VARCHAR,\n    INDUSTRY        VARCHAR,\n    ANNUAL_REVENUE  NUMBER(18,2),\n    ACCOUNT_STATUS  VARCHAR,\n    BILLING_STATE   VARCHAR(2),\n    INGESTED_TS     TIMESTAMP_NTZ DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()\n);",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null
    },
    {
      "id": "97560b8d-8db4-4cc5-b249-a2f766347056",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "codeCollapsed": false
      },
      "source": "## Step 5 â€“ Synthetic daily snapshots (days 1â€“4)\n| Day | EFECTIVE_DT | Scenario |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 2026-11-01 | Initial snapshot, 5 accounts |\n| 2 | 2026-11-02 | 001 revenue 5.0M â†’ 5.5M, 002 Prospect â†’ Customer, 006 new account |\n| 3 | 2026-11-03 | No changes (dbt should insert nothing) |\n| 4 | 2026-11-04 | 001 renamed **Acme CapitalOne**, 005 Inactive â†’ Active |"
    },
    {
      "id": "103bf4b8-e0b2-4e3d-b1f5-7d53250b4af9",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "sql",
        "resultVariableName": "step5_day1_2",
        "title": "Load day 1 and day 2"
      },
      "source": "%%sql -r step5_day1_2\nINSERT INTO FIN_DB.RAW.ACCOUNT VALUES\n('001A000001','2026-11-01','Acme Capital',     'Customer','Banking',   5000000.00,'Active',  'NY','2026-11-01 06:00:00'),\n('001A000002','2026-11-01','Blue River Wealth','Prospect','Asset Mgmt',1200000.00,'Active',  'CA','2026-11-01 06:00:00'),\n('001A000003','2026-11-01','Cedar Insurance',  'Customer','Insurance', 8700000.00,'Active',  'IA','2026-11-01 06:00:00'),\n('001A000004','2026-11-01','Delta Retirement', 'Partner', 'Pension',   3300000.00,'Active',  'TX','2026-11-01 06:00:00'),\n('001A000005','2026-11-01','Evergreen Trust',  'Customer','Trust',      950000.00,'Inactive','WA','2026-11-01 06:00:00'),\n('001A000001','2026-11-02','Acme Capital',     'Customer','Banking',   5500000.00,'Active',  'NY','2026-11-02 06:00:00'),\n('001A000002','2026-11-02','Blue River Wealth','Customer','Asset Mgmt',1200000.00,'Active',  'CA','2026-11-02 06:00:00'),\n('001A000003','2026-11-02','Cedar Insurance',  'Customer','Insurance', 8700000.00,'Active',  'IA','2026-11-02 06:00:00'),\n('001A000004','2026-11-02','Delta Retirement', 'Partner', 'Pension',   3300000.00,'Active',  'TX','2026-11-02 06:00:00'),\n('001A000005','2026-11-02','Evergreen Trust',  'Customer','Trust',      950000.00,'Inactive','WA','2026-11-02 06:00:00'),\n('001A000006','2026-11-02','Falcon Advisors',  'Prospect','Advisory',   400000.00,'Active',  'IL','2026-11-02 06:00:00');",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4ba079af-4a73-4c9e-9bb9-c03cae36b328",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "sql",
        "resultVariableName": "step5_day3",
        "title": "Load day 3 (no changes)"
      },
      "source": "%%sql -r step5_day3\nINSERT INTO FIN_DB.RAW.ACCOUNT\nSELECT SLSFRC_ID, '2026-11-03', ACCOUNT_NAME, ACCOUNT_TYPE, INDUSTRY, ANNUAL_REVENUE,\n       ACCOUNT_STATUS, BILLING_STATE, '2026-11-03 06:00:00'\nFROM FIN_DB.RAW.ACCOUNT WHERE EFECTIVE_DT = '2026-11-02';",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5c34aba9-a2c9-4f1a-8065-38eec2b75727",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "sql",
        "resultVariableName": "step5_day4",
        "title": "Load day 4 (rename + reactivation)"
      },
      "source": "%%sql -r step5_day4\nINSERT INTO FIN_DB.RAW.ACCOUNT\nSELECT SLSFRC_ID, '2026-11-04',\n       IFF(SLSFRC_ID = '001A000001', 'Acme CapitalOne', ACCOUNT_NAME),\n       ACCOUNT_TYPE, INDUSTRY, ANNUAL_REVENUE,\n       IFF(SLSFRC_ID = '001A000005', 'Active', ACCOUNT_STATUS),\n       BILLING_STATE, '2026-11-04 06:00:00'\nFROM FIN_DB.RAW.ACCOUNT WHERE EFECTIVE_DT = '2026-11-03';",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null
    },
    {
      "id": "41e3a5d6-d481-4131-94cd-0b8c5eedefb8",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "codeCollapsed": false
      },
      "source": "## Step 6 â€“ Source view\ndbt reads from this view (`source('raw','vw_account_src')`), not from the table directly."
    },
    {
      "id": "b91f2cb5-c197-44ad-813a-edee0a366a7b",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "sql",
        "resultVariableName": "step6_view",
        "title": "Create source view"
      },
      "source": "%%sql -r step6_view\nCREATE OR REPLACE VIEW FIN_DB.RAW.VW_ACCOUNT_SRC AS\nSELECT SLSFRC_ID, EFECTIVE_DT, ACCOUNT_NAME, ACCOUNT_TYPE, INDUSTRY,\n       ANNUAL_REVENUE, ACCOUNT_STATUS, BILLING_STATE, INGESTED_TS\nFROM FIN_DB.RAW.ACCOUNT;",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b8a17c32-2090-498c-b6e5-82f667864b9b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "codeCollapsed": false
      },
      "source": "## Step 7 â€“ Validation\nExpected row counts: **5 / 6 / 6 / 6 = 23 raw rows**. The second query shows each account's attributes by day, so the changes dbt should detect are easy to see."
    },
    {
      "id": "438122da-8c4d-4dfe-9b88-8cc4e581977a",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "sql",
        "resultVariableName": "raw_row_counts",
        "title": "Row counts per effective date"
      },
      "source": "%%sql -r raw_row_counts\nSELECT EFECTIVE_DT, COUNT(*) AS ROWS_LOADED\nFROM FIN_DB.RAW.VW_ACCOUNT_SRC\nGROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1;",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3d7e8d13-4c88-49c5-afac-11d8adaad573",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "sql",
        "resultVariableName": "raw_detail",
        "title": "Raw snapshot detail"
      },
      "source": "%%sql -r raw_detail\nSELECT SLSFRC_ID, EFECTIVE_DT, ACCOUNT_NAME, ACCOUNT_TYPE, ANNUAL_REVENUE, ACCOUNT_STATUS, INGESTED_TS\nFROM FIN_DB.RAW.VW_ACCOUNT_SRC\nORDER BY SLSFRC_ID, EFECTIVE_DT;",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ae5e0040-ffd2-4a34-ad8f-246d760af1dc",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "codeCollapsed": false
      },
      "source": "## Next steps â€“ dbt project\n1. Create the `fin_account_dbt` dbt project in Workspaces (`dbt_project.yml`, `dbt_projects_profiles.yml`, `sources.yml`, `stg_account.sql`, `slv_account.sql`, tests).\n2. `dbt build --select slv_account --full-refresh` â†’ expect **10 rows** in `FIN_DB.SILVER.SLV_ACCOUNT`, none dated 2026-11-03.\n3. Deploy with `CREATE DBT PROJECT FIN_DB.SILVER.FIN_ACCOUNT_DBT`, then schedule it with a Task."
    }
  ]
}*
